त्यागी सत्त्वसमाविष्टो मेधावी छिन्नसंशय: ॥ १० ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":4490,\"bb\":3940,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/10/b3940/\",\"body_value\":\"na dveṣṭy akuśalaṁ karma
kuśale nānuṣajjate
tyāgī sattva-samāviṣṭo
medhāvī chinna-saṁśayaḥ\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":4491,\"bb\":3941,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/10/b3941/\",\"shadow_value\":\"na – never; dveṣṭi – hates; akuśalam – inauspicious; karma – work; kuśale – in the auspicious; na – nor; anuṣajjate – becomes attached; tyāgī – the renouncer; sattva – in goodness; samāviṣṭaḥ – absorbed; medhāvī – intelligent; chinna – having cut off; saṁśayaḥ – all doubts.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"na\",\"translation\":\"never\"},{\"word\":\"dveṣṭi\",\"translation\":\"hates\"},{\"word\":\"akuśalam\",\"translation\":\"inauspicious\"},{\"word\":\"karma\",\"translation\":\"work\"},{\"word\":\"kuśale\",\"translation\":\"in the auspicious\"},{\"word\":\"na\",\"translation\":\"nor\"},{\"word\":\"anuṣajjate\",\"translation\":\"becomes attached\"},{\"word\":\"tyāgī\",\"translation\":\"the renouncer\"},{\"word\":\"sattva\",\"translation\":\"in goodness\"},{\"word\":\"samāviṣṭaḥ\",\"translation\":\"absorbed\"},{\"word\":\"medhāvī\",\"translation\":\"intelligent\"},{\"word\":\"chinna\",\"translation\":\"having cut off\"},{\"word\":\"saṁśayaḥ\",\"translation\":\"all doubts\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":4492,\"bb\":3942,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/10/b3942/\",\"body_value\":\"The intelligent renouncer situated in the mode of goodness, neither hateful of inauspicious work nor attached to auspicious work, has no doubts about work.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":4493,\"bb\":3943,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/10/b3943/\",\"body_value\":\"A person in Kṛṣṇa consciousness or in the mode of goodness does not hate anyone or anything which troubles his body. He does work in the pro